      "text": "Kitten TTS 2 is a small-footprint, multilingual text-to-speech model developed by KittenML. It uses a MeanFlow decoder and speaker encoders to synthesize speech from text in multiple languages, shipping with 48 built-in voice profiles. The model is distributed as quantized GGUF files (BF16, Q8, Q4) for efficient CPU/GPU inference and is supported by the audio.cpp runtime, enabling local, real-time speech generation without cloud APIs."
